            tag: "message",
            portrait: "none",
            text: _("<i>_ Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers rushed thankfully through the miraculously opened passage. _ The sounds of rupturing earth behind rose to a crescendo, then faded into the distance, as meanwhile an uncomfortable heat pressed close at their backs.</i>"),
          },
