            id: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Even worse, the bulk of our stores and rations have been lost to the lava! Hunger and weakness already gnaw at my stomach. We must find a way to the surface soon, or these caves may yet prove our doom..."),
          },
        ],
      },
